window.products.push({"id":922061,"name":"Knife Set, Vestaware Kitchen Knife Set 16 Pieces German High Carbon Stainless Steel Knife Block Set with Ergonomic Handle, Kitchen Knives, Ultra Sharp","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":119.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yDja5tLgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ultra Sharp Knife Set: Multipurpose chef's knife comes with an HRC( Rockwell Hardness Scale) of 52±2 and ultra-sharp edge which achieves optimum sharpness and long-lasting razor edge retention. The superb cutting performance of a sharp knife set ensures precise but effortless slicing, dicing, and chopping on any food prep. Excellent Quality Knife Set With Block: The kitchen knife set is made of high-carbon stainless steel with outstanding resistance to rust, corrosion, and discoloration. The knife block adopts premium solid wood for higher reliability and a sleek looking. High-quality basic cutlery knife designed for chopping, mincing, dicing, and slicing fruits, vegetables, meat, steak, bread, and so on. Ergonomic Handle: Each kitchen knife handle is made of rosewood for corrosion resistance, free from heat, cold and wet effects. The three rivets embedded in the handle to reinforce the handle make the knife more stylish and durable. Easy to Care: All knives store safely in the rosewood knife block. ( Don't use the dishwasher, hand-wash recommended) This knife set with a block is essential for both professional and amateur cooks. It sets you apart. Perfect gift for Weddings, Birthdays, Thanksgiving and Halloween, etc. What Do You Get: an 8’’ chef knife, 6’’ chef knife, 8’’ bread knife, 8’’ slicing knife, 7’’ santoku knife, 4.5’’ utility knife, 3.5’’ paring knife, 6pcs steak knife, 10’’ kitchen shears, 8’’ walnut sharpener and wooden block. We offer a 3-month refund and a lifetime free replacement warranty to ensure customer satisfaction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yDja5tLgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vestaware","source_asin":"B0C5MVP9ZC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-922061","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C5MVP9ZC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C5MVP9ZC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
