window.products.push({"id":922084,"name":"HOMEIDEAS Bathroom Runner Rugs Grey, Includes 1 Long Bath Rug Runner 47\"x27\", 1 U-Shaped Contour Toilet Mat 20\" x24“, Ultra Soft Non Slip and Absorben","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+hnQrIPJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[ULTRA SOFT BATHROOM RUGS] 1 U-Shape Contoured Rug 20\"x24\", 1 Long Bathroom Rug Runner 47\"x27\". These upgraded luxurious shag rugs can soak up the water and keep your floor dry like a giant sponge, made of plenty of shaggy microfibers, each fiber about 1 inch and more compact and thick to arrange together, the rug set soft enough like sinking into a deep shag pile while you step on it. [NON-SLIP BATH RUGS - PVC BOTTOM] Non-slip bottom is made of high-quality PVC material. This anti-skid backing has practically slip resistance on the tile floor surface, that it won’t slip or slide to keep you more safe and cozy. Unlike other brands where the rubber backing tends to wear and peel off after several washes. The rugs are much stronger and durable for long-lasting use. [HIGH WATER ABSORBENCY] High-pile, thick Chenille fabric helps save your floors from dripping water while you're stepping out of the bath, Jacuzzi, shower, or getting ready by the sink. Moisture is trapped in the bathroom mat's deep pile, allowing the rug to dry quickly and cleanly. Place rug on CLEAN DRY SMOOTH FLOOR only. Water under the rug can cause it to slip. Keep bottom of rug dry. [DURABLE BATHROOM RUGS RUNNER] Unique fiber-locking technique, say goodbye to horrible fiber-dropping! Thicker and better constructed than most other brands. Great gift idea for all occasions, Christmas, Wedding, Fathers Day, Mothers Day, Valentines, Birth Day & Etc. [MACHINE WASHABLE] Wash on cold with mild detergent. Use only non-chlorine bleach when needed, hang to dry, or air dry flat. Do not Bleach or Dry Clean. After 10 times machine wash test, our large bathroom rugs still look as good as the new one. No worry about it getting the fibers off, it's really easy to handle and care for. Very durable material, the color will stay nice and vibrant for years to come no matter how many times they’ll be washed and dried.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+hnQrIPJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMEIDEAS","source_asin":"B087FYPVYJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-922084","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087FYPVYJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B087FYPVYJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
