window.products.push({"id":922124,"name":"Horticultural Grade Perlite - One 8 Quart Bag ~2 Lbs - Grade 1, Fine Coarseness (~1/8 Inch Particles) - Soil Amendment Additive - for Growth, Aeration","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.54,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FbPGiLg-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PURE HORTICULTURAL GRADE PERLITE - Each Bag is 8 Quarts and ~2 lbs - Grade 1, Fine Coarseness (granule size about one eighth of an inch) - Mountain Valley Seed Company Brand SOIL ADDITIVE - Add to any potting mix for seed starting and long term growth of plants that don't like over watering like cacti and succulents, container plants - Helps grow stronger root systems on most plants IMPROVES SOIL DRAINAGE - Improves water drainage and provides insulation for roots against the cold - Won't degrade, rot or mold IMPROVES SOIL AERATION - Aerates soils for healthier roots, Loosens compacted soil and helps keep soil from compacting NON-TOXIC - All natrual, sterile, odorless - pH ranges from 7 (neutral) to 7.5 (slightly alkaline) - Can be used as a substitute for sand and as a hydroponic medium","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FbPGiLg-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mountain Valley Seed Company","source_asin":"B08VN8GFNN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-922124","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VN8GFNN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VN8GFNN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":922125,"name":"YFS Professional Stainless Steel Cocktail Muddler, Durable Easy to Use Bar Tool , Copper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71svuaB0UIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"RISK FREE PURCHASE GUARANTEE!-We are commited to bringing you the best quality.If you are not 100% satisfied with us,Please contact us,we will replace your item or refund you.You have my word!!! Customer Voice: This muddler is awesome! I have been meaning to order a nice non-wooden muddler for sometime now as I have been using a pampered chef tool not specified for this purpose. The price was great and I was very excited when it arrived. I have only used it a couple of times, but it works great! It is easy to clean and light weight too. The 8\" size is perfect for rocks glasses and martini mixers! I would highly recommend this product. Customer Voice: Mashes fruit nicely I bought this muddler to crush berries to mix with non-fat yogurt for a diabetic diet. I use it every morning. It can be tough to clean berry guts out of the \"teeth\" if you let it dry and harden, but soaking the business end in hot water (or cleaning it promptly) helps. It's also nice that the muddler is dishwasher safe. Also, I like saying \"muddler\" Customer Voice: Well Made Never thought I needed a cocktail muddler but some drinks call for muddling sugar etc. and I love having every gadget. This works very well, easy to clean and it's sturdy. Plus, my NYC bartender Nephew gave it his seal of approval. Glad I purchased it. I rinse it by hand, don't know how it would hold up in the dishwasher. Customer Voice: Reliable & Good Quality! Purchased multiple for a crafting cocktails and it was perfect to crush mint/basil leaves/fruit. Easy to wash and throw into the dishwasher if needed. Stainless steel is reliable, smooth, and looks great!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71svuaB0UIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YFS","source_asin":"B07RTSHHPR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-922125","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RTSHHPR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RTSHHPR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
