window.products.push({"id":922251,"name":"Earthquake E43 1-Person Earth Auger Powerhead, 43cc 2-Cycle Viper Engine, 30:1 Transmission, 5 Year Limited Warranty","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":280.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712YNXQ+5UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With the E43 powerhead and included 8-inch auger bit you can drill deep into the earth in just seconds. Engineered to be reliable and long-lasting, Earthquake powerheads make any digging project easier and faster. Outstanding power, durability and efficiency from a 1-man earth auger. Industrial air filtration keeps dirt out of your engine and running smooth. The Powerhead is lightweight yet built with heavy-duty construction using steel handlebars. The transmission features ball bearings and alloy gears built to withstand the challenges of digging in the dirt. The powerhead features anti-vibration foam-grip handles, with an easy-to-grip fingertip throttle control. The included 8” auger is constructed of durable steel, heavy-duty welds and a powder coat finish. Complete with fishtail point, Flex Coil Shock absorber and replaceable blades your auger will stand the test of time. Decks, mailboxes, fences, tree planting and multiple other landscaping and agriculture needs. For over 60 years, Earthquake has been producing Earth Auger power heads and drills.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712YNXQ+5UL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EARTHQUAKE","source_asin":"B07Y45XY19","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-922251","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07Y45XY19","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07Y45XY19","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":922252,"name":"10.5 Inch Microwaveable Glass Plate Cover with Easy-Grip Silicone Handle - Keeps Food from Splattering - Promotes Quick Heating - Cool-Touch Handle - ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31Iveh8pEuL._AC_.jpg","description":"The 10.5 Inch Microwaveable Glass Plate Cover with Easy-Grip Silicone Handle is a must-have accessory for your microwave cooking needs. This multipurpose lid prevents food from splattering, swiftly heats it, and provides a secure and comfortable grip thanks to its cool-touch handle. It's the ideal addition to any kitchen because of its amazing features and top-notch workmanship.With this plate cover, you can successfully prevent splatter while heating and keep your microwave clean, saying goodbye to messy cleanups. Dishwasher safety makes cleanup simple and convenient.Preserve the flavor and texture of your food by trapping moisture inside with our plate cover. Enjoy a moist and delicious eating experience every time you reheat food in the microwave.Crafted from durable borosilicate glass, this plate cover withstands intense microwave waves. Designed to fit 11-inch plates, it provides optimal coverage for your food.The standout feature is the easy-grip silicone handle that remains cool to the touch, ensuring safe and comfortable handling even when the cover is hot.This plate cover is versatile and safe to use in the microwave, oven, freezer, and dishwasher, making it suitable for various cooking and storage needs.In summary, the 10.5 Inch Microwaveable Glass Plate Cover with Easy-Grip Silicone Handle is a practical and reliable solution for microwave cooking. It contains splatter, retains moisture, and offers a cool-touch handle. Crafted from high-quality glass, it's durable and heat-resistant. With its versatile design and easy maintenance, this plate cover is a valuable addition to any kitchen. Elevate your microwave cooking experience with this exceptional product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31Iveh8pEuL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B089XCBMKK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-922252","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089XCBMKK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089XCBMKK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
