window.products.push({"id":922314,"name":"Allrecipes Hard Anodized Nonstick 3-in-1 Oval Roaster with Au Gratin & Aroma Lids, 4Piece, 8.5 quart, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KSlppC6lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Allrecipes 4-Piece hard anodized nonstick 3-in-1 oval roaster includes the roasting pan, a lid that can be used as an au gratin/casserole dish, a stainless steel roasting rack, and a multi-purpose glass aroma lid. The combination of potential uses makes this the ultimate set for versatility and multi-tasking in the kitchen. The 8.5 quart Capacity roasting pan holds up to a 16 pound turkey or can be used like a Dutch oven on the stovetop for large-batch soups and more. The stainless steel roasting rack can be hung from the sides of the pan to allow juices from meat to drip into the roaster for a flavorful gravy. The 4 quart au gratin pan can be used as a lid for the roasting pan; on its own as a casserole dish or for roasting fish, meat or vegetables in the oven; or directly on the stovetop as a saute pan, fry pan, or griddle. The vented glass lid - which fits both the roasting pan and the au gratin pan - allows you to \"cook and look,\" keeping track of how a dish is progressing. The glass lid also features a small hole that allows you to drip in oil or wine to enhance the braising process and keep food moist. Elegant enough to take directly to the table for serving, this Allrecipes set is sure to become a go-to in your kitchen. Cleanup is a breeze thanks to PFOA-free nonstick coating in both the roaster and au gratin pan. All pieces are dishwasher safe. A note from our kitchen: the Allrecipes 3-in-1 oval roaster works on all stovetops except induction. Home cooks come to Allrecipes for everyday inspiration and practical, reliable solutions for food and cooking needs. Our cookware and kitchen products provide clever, solution-based features that remove the guesswork from cooking and make prep and cleanup easier.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KSlppC6lL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Allrecipes","source_asin":"B01N1TWTML","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-922314","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N1TWTML","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N1TWTML","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
