window.products.push({"id":922355,"name":"Chinese Fengshui Handmade Brass Wealth Horse Statues with Coins Home Decor Business Gift","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":57.77,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VbQrEKgTL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Equine symbol to facilitate promotion, success and prosperity . This Brass Jumping Horse features a prancing Horse to signify upward mobility and promotion, steady and speedy climb to fame, success in career and victory in life.  The symbolic success is reflected by the abundance of gold ingots, a replica of the ancient Chinese gold ingot known as as Yuen Bao in Chinese - symbol of wealth and fortune with the incorporation of auspicious coins at its base to further reinforce its potency as a wealth enhancer. Display the Brass Jumping Horse to enjoy a distinguished career, success, triumph, abundance, good luck and prosperity.  The brass material also makes this an excellent metal cure for the hostile #2 Illness and #5 Yellow Stars.  It is also pertinent to note that this equine beauty is also ideal for those born under zodiac sign of the Sheep as well as those whose zodiac signs are the Dog and Tiger based on the horoscope allies and secret friends chart. Product Size— Length 5.5'', width 3.3'', height 7.5''. Because of manual measurement, the size will be a little error, please understanding. Product Material— Brass. Handmade, work very well Metal material, durable, easy to clean. Product Design— There is a symbol of the four season pattern in the pen container, Spring orchids, Summer bamboo, Autumn chrysanthemum, Winter Plum blossom. A symbol of China's four gentlemen. Cleaning— Gently whisk the surface of brass with a soft cloth if it need clean. You can use vinegar to wipe the rust if it is rusty after a long time. Product Usage— It can be placed in your room to refresh the decor appeal of short spaces. Also a good gift and personal collection. No matter view from which point, it is a work of art. Dear friends,we are grateful for your choice.If you have any questions or suggestions,please feel free to contact us.We will do our best to service to you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71VbQrEKgTL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Brass Statu","source_asin":"B07D4H5VV9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-922355","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D4H5VV9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D4H5VV9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":922356,"name":"RRC Black and White Tapestry, Yinyang Wall Hanging Tapestry, Mandala Tapestries, Indian Traditional Cotton Printed Bohemian Hippie Small Wall Art Tape","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tFZ1kSJGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Yin and Yang can be thought of as complementary (rather than opposing) forces that interact to form a dynamic system in which the whole is greater than the assembled parts. Everything has both Yin and Yang aspects, (for instance shadow cannot exist without light). Two complementary principles of Chinese philosophy: one negative, dark, passive and feminine (Yin) and one positive, bright, active and masculine (Yang) whose interaction influences the destinies of creatures and things. Mandala is a spiritual and ritual symbol in Indian religions, representing the universe. The Mandala appears to us in all aspects of life, the Earth, the Sun, the Moon and more obviously the circles of life encompassing friends, family and communities. Mandalas are circular designs symbolizing the notion that life is never ending. Many mandalas have spiritual significance to an individual or group of individuals.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81tFZ1kSJGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RRC","source_asin":"B08CCFHFY5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-922356","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CCFHFY5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CCFHFY5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
