window.products.push({"id":922361,"name":"Royal Doulton Provence Noir Light 12 1/2-Ounce Creamer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Q7Y70KMBL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Provence, a pattern based on the famous French Toile du Jouy fabric, named after the Manufacture Royale de Jouy, in a small town near Versailles, southwest of Paris. Amazon.com With its elegantly rendered line drawings of flowers and fruit, this toile-patterned creamer from British chinaware maker Royal Doulton brings the relaxed elegance of Provence to the breakfast table. Cheery and contemporary, the creamer features neutral shades of black, beige and ivory that would coordinate with many decors. The 12-1/2-ounce creamer is suitable for informal dining and the perfect accompaniment to morning tea or after-dinner coffee. When not in use, it's pretty enough to display prominently on a kitchen windowsill or hutch. The black and ivory toile pattern is bordered with narrow taupe braids at the top and bottom. The design includes a white handle and spout. The vibrant, eye-catching pattern, called Provence Noir, matches or coordinates with sugar bowls, mugs and more in Royal Doulton's French country collection, so you can use your imagination to create a one-of-a-kind look for your table. Durable and easy to maintain, the creamer is safe for use in dishwashers, microwaves, freezers and ovens. --Susannah Detlef","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Q7Y70KMBL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Royal Doulton","source_asin":"B00023EBDC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-922361","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00023EBDC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00023EBDC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
