window.products.push({"id":922569,"name":"Bosen's Reserved Chin-Zhou [Jinko] Aloeswood-8\" Stick incense-100% Natural-F309T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613Zey+D1ZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This is made of classic ripening aged agarwood from Sorong, Indonesia. One of high-end series Chin-Zhou agarwood. It has a mellow, strong and elegant agarwood note with a clear earthy atmosphere of Indonesian loess. Because this series agarwood was discovered in swamp area, it has a bit of grassy sweetness. But some may feel it is relatively light and sweet with some bitterness. The smell will get better and better day by day if stored well. We guarantee there is no extraction of agarwood essential oil before making this incense. Raw materials are 100% natural.p.s. This incense contains stronger agarwood scent and is prepared for those who are agarwood favorites, it may not be appropriate for beginners. If you can't feel this smell, we strongly suggest you to burn it at different time. Such as in cool and higher humid days will have a much clearer aroma indoors.***Key Ingredients: +Reserved [2nd grade] Indonesian Chin-Zhou aloeswood (92%, contains 4% jinko agarwood)+Machilus zuihensis Hayata powder (8%)Please note:--For those who got used to perfumed incense with strong scent, you may not be able to feel this fully natural fragrance. We suggest to fresh your nose for a few days (in order to recover olfactory senses) before burning this incense. **This incense will smell better in cool seasons.--In the international market of raw materials, raw agarwood (Aloeswood) has become very expensive now because of its scarce. The value of agarwood (aloeswood) incense is based on its purity and smell. Agarwood incense contains stronger and sweet aroma with higher purity will be more popular and priced higher.--If you feel too smokey while burning this incense, please open window to keep the air circulation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613Zey+D1ZL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bosen Incense","source_asin":"B085H6FHKN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-922569","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085H6FHKN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085H6FHKN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
