window.products.push({"id":922790,"name":"Nagina International Real Simple...A HANDTOOLED Handcrafted Brass Porthole Mirror!!","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":60.44,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yeH9KNf-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A Porthole, Sometimes Called Bull's-Eye Is A Generally Circular Metallic Frame Used On The Hull Of Ships To Admit Light And Air. Though The Term Is Of Maritime Origin, It Is Also Used To Describe Round Circular Openings On Armored Vehicles, Aircraft, Automobiles And Even Spacecraft etc | On A Ship, The Function Of A Porthole, When Open Is To Permit Light And Fresh Air To Enter The Dark And Often Damp Below-Deck Quarters Of The Vessel. It Also Affords Below-Deck Occupants A Limited View To The Outside World When Closed In Ancient Times | Our Replica Is Still As Functional As Ancient Times But Not 100% Air-Tight / Air Proof. It Is A Classy And Quality Accent Piece To Add To Any Nautical Themed Room. This Charming Nautical Port Is Both Functional And Stylish. This Beautiful Porthole Will Accent Your Nautical Wall Decor Perfectly. Place This Item In Your Lake House, Bar, Or Any Other Nautical Themed Room You Can Imagine. This Mediterranean-Style Wall Mounting Decor Ornament Is Perfect Choice For Living Room, Home Or Shop, Office, Pirate Themes Room, Seaside Gardens, Patio, Tiki-Bar, Floating Tiki, Nature Adventurous Wild Camps, Vans etc. Possibilities Are Endless & Limitless.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yeH9KNf-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nagina International","source_asin":"B008E4WL0Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-922790","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008E4WL0Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008E4WL0Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":922791,"name":"Keurig K75 Single-Cup Home-Brewing System with Water Filter Kit, Platinum/Mocha","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71stIpJqAAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Platinum Brewing System is Keurig's best single-cup brewing system for your home. This premium model brews a perfect cup of coffee, tea, hot cocoa or iced beverage at the touch of a button. and offers discerning coffee drinkers the widest range of five cup size options for brewing. it offers the full spectrum of features including Auto On/Off, Digital Clock, Adjustable Temperature Control and the \"Set Your Favorite Cup Size\" (4 oz., 6 oz., 8 oz., 10 oz. and 12 oz. option). 72 oz. removable water reservoir holds up to ten cups before refilling and the removable drip tray allows for easy cleaning and the use of travel mugs. The sleek, award-winning design is a unique footprint among Keurig's line of home brewing systems and includes both a blue lit water reservoir and blue lit LCD display. At initial set up, once the machine is filled with water, it will take approximately 4-minutes for the water will be heated. During the heating period the red light next to HEATING on the LED Control Center will become illuminated. Once the water is heated, the red light will turn off and the Small Mug Button will flash. Press the Small Mug Button to start a cleansing brew. Pour the hot water into the sink. The Brewer may take 15 seconds to reheat water between brews during which time the red light next to HEATING on the LED Control Center may be illuminated. When the water has heated, the red light will turn off. The one-time set-up process is now complete and you are ready to brew.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71stIpJqAAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Keurig","source_asin":"B00AWLBEEI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-922791","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00AWLBEEI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00AWLBEEI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
