window.products.push({"id":922794,"name":"West Bend 7010 Stainless-Steel 800-Watt Juice Extractor with Blender Attachment (Discontinued by Manufacturer)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nkiYms0aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Equipped with a powerful 800-watt motor, this juice extractor makes it easy to access all the nutrients and great taste from fresh fruits and vegetables. Choose from two speed settings--low speed for juicing soft fruits and vegetables like oranges, melons, grapes, and fresh summer berries or high speed for harder produce like carrots, celery, cabbage, and beets. It also provides a \"pulse\" function for controlled bursts of power. The unit's 3-inch-wide food chute with a pusher accommodates large pieces of produce, while its generous 1-quart-capacity juice jug makes it possible to create large batches for the whole family to enjoy. Simply add produce through the feed tube, flip on the power switch, and it takes care of the rest, dispensing juice through the side spout into the included juice jug or other container. Pulp and seeds eject automatically into a separate 2-quart pulp bin for quick disposal or composting, or, better yet, for adding to sauces, soups, salsa, jams, cakes, and more. The appliance also provides a blender attachment with a 1.9-quart glass blending jar for mixing up frozen drinks, fruit smoothies, milkshakes, and more. The blending jar comes with an easy-grip handle, a secure-fitting lid, and a nondrip spout for graceful serving. Other highlights include a built-in safety lock, non-slip feet, cord storage, and dishwasher-safe parts for convenient cleanup. Attractively housed in stainless steel, the juice extractor measures approximately 12 by 10 by 18 inches and carries a one-year limited warranty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nkiYms0aL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"West Bend","source_asin":"B001T6FM2A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-922794","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001T6FM2A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001T6FM2A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
